    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d149-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d149-f1-content">
                <p>Circulated to the members of the National Security Council and to the Secretaries
                    of the Treasury and Commerce, the Economic Cooperation Administrator, the
                    Director of the Bureau of the Budget, and the Chairman of the Council of
                    Economic Advisers, by Executive Secretary Lay under the cover of a memorandum
                    dated December 14 (S/S–NSC Files: Lot 63D351:NSC 68 Series).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
